{"id": 1008170, "slug": "strange-jigsaws", "name": "Strange Jigsaws", "name_original": "Strange Jigsaws", "description": "<p>Strange Jigsaws is a puzzle game where you solve strange jigsaws. </p><ul><li><p> Solve around 50 or so strange jigsaws, each with their own surprising way of being solved. </p></li><li><p> Explore unusual puzzle worlds themed after jigsaws. </p></li><li><p> Enter the Jigsawverse, maybe. </p></li></ul><p>This is a spiritual sequel to my game \"20 Small Mazes\", but it's a little bit harder.</p><p>I recommend playing the game using keyboard and mouse.</p><p>Notes on puzzle accessibility: </p><ul><li><p> The game is color-blind friendly. There are two puzzles that use color and they both have a \"colorblind mode\" toggle on the puzzle itself.</p></li><li><p> The game has accessibility options for hard of hearing or deaf people. There are three separate track of subtitles: background music, sound effects, and voices.</p></li><li><p> Some puzzles require knowledge of English. </p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-08-07", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-08-31T10:59:56", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/007/007cc438c457aa74a1e9e0bff5f230b8.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/4e0/4e03c7d4eb2b003e28e69969614f6767.jpg", "website": "https://www.flebpuzzles.com", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 2, "percent": 66.67}, {"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 1, "percent": 33.33}], "reactions": null, "added": 7, "added_by_status": {"owned": 2, "beaten": 2, "toplay": 2, "dropped": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 3